{"id":605,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"二十分テストと個別対応で伸ばす学力","feature_description":"金蘭千里は、少人数制の中高一貫教育で、生徒の自主独立を育てることを掲げます。授業と二十分テストを軸に学習習慣と学力を伸ばし、学習・生活・進路の各面で個別対応を行います。中学から探究型プログラムを取り入れ、ICTも活用しながら学びを深めます。全科目を大切にする教育、行事やクラブ活動での協働、日本文化や異文化に触れる機会を通じて、主体的な進路選択を支えます。","clubs":[{"id":11461,"name":"男子サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kinransenri.ed.jp/life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11462,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kinransenri.ed.jp/life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11463,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kinransenri.ed.jp/life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11464,"name":"女子ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kinransenri.ed.jp/life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11465,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kinransenri.ed.jp/life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11466,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kinransenri.ed.jp/life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11467,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kinransenri.ed.jp/life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11468,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kinransenri.ed.jp/life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11469,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kinransenri.ed.jp/life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11470,"name":"合唱部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kinransenri.ed.jp/life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11471,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kinransenri.ed.jp/life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11472,"name":"写真部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kinransenri.ed.jp/life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11473,"name":"科学部